     7	
     8	# Context
     9	
    10	Review the completed implementation against its approved plan,
    11	`PROJECT/2-WORKING/GH-1409-VENDORED-SMOKE-BASE-PIN.md` (plan QA approved and attested in
    12	`relay-system/2026-11-10/gh1409-plan-qa.md`, round 4).
    13	
    14	**Operational envelope.** Same as plan QA: a public single-maintainer repo; the goal is to stop a PR from
    15	weakening vendored-smoke's own judge files in the same change. The operator accepted the `ci.yml`
    16	self-edit loophole and dropped CODEOWNERS. `AGENTS.md` forbids new tests, suites and gate machinery
    17	(GH-831); a new test file or registry entry in the diff would itself be a finding. Grade against R1–R5
    18	and commensurate complexity.
